505 - I Need the Prayers
 / 
Key: C
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 505
Topic: Christian Life - 

Verse 1:
[C]I need the prayers of those I love, While trav'ling [G]o'er life's rugged way,
[G]That I may true [C]and faithful be, And live for Jesus every day.
[C]I want [G]my friends to pray for me, To bear my tempted soul [C]a-bove,
[C]And intercede [F]with God for me; I [C]need the prayers of those I love.

Refrain:
[C]I want my friends to pray [G]for me,
[C]To bear [F]my tempted soul above,
[F]And intercede [G]with God for me;
[G]I need the prayers of those [C]I love.

Verse 2:
[C]I need the prayers of those [G]I love,
[G]To help [C]me in each trying hour,
[C]To [G]bear my tempted sould to [C]Him,
[C]That [F]He may keep me [C]by His pow'r.

Verse 3:
[C]I want my friends to pray [G]for me,
[G]To hold [C]me up on wing of faith,
[C]That [G]I may walk the narrow [C]way,
[C]Kept [F]by our Father's [C]glorious grace.
